<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Hold Monster</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Spell Tier: 3
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 27)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast hold monster &lt;target&gt;
</pre>
<p>The caster spits upon the ground and utters 'Mag desi', and magic engulfs 
the target, leaving it unable to fight: it misses two to five combat 
rounds, more the better the casting goes, and it can't flee in panic 
meanwhile.
</p><p>It is a hard spell to master, and it can go wrong in ways that hurt:
</p>
<ul><li>cast very poorly, it misfires, and you hold yourself for three rounds;</li>
<li>cast a little better, nothing happens;</li>
<li>cast fairly well, it holds you both for three rounds;</li>
<li>cast well, it holds the target only.</li></ul>
<p>The target resists with its mind. Humans, elves, dwarves and other 
humanoids are much harder to hold, and the undead can't be held at all 
(see hold undead). Casting it is an attack, so the target will fight you 
if it wasn't already. No free hands are needed, and it is also found on 
wands, scrolls and potions.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Hold Animal</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Hold Undead</a>
